i": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491829120_2036173267333260_8432217609145998631_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hKIbKMUgaMQQ7kNvwHim0Ag&_nc_oc=Adped2wfg7XsqsVm9xKX3F69lxvl9ws3IyfD1Fc0HnvxQOut3bOju9VG8g911RKw3Gk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_WNvJWciThoBYS8q6CU-Gt6u00iRUwiBfx8h9nSdsMzQ&oe=6A2C2D26"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "GnC_CoverArt_2560x1440_WithLogo.png", "id": "951277200945788", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_951277207612454_1527621256683764070_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tOvMgtEnPwIQ7kNvwHe3qci&_nc_oc=AdoIrdRMPlCQbFZEQRxvmCXsMKtdVhOd5ZaXbjzA50TkL6qJVFNHSm_qhYkmpTf1Y1c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9DCL9JIsWE4u2Loe0Ao9KQbHbXwkZoSj1zj7kJdCbpqw&oe=6A2C283C"}, "display_name": "Gas N Cars", "keywords": ["sandbox", "simulation", "physics", "funny", "gasstation"], "long_description": "\u26fd **Serve Customers & Fuel Cars**\n\n Earn honest cash for good service\u2026 or spill gas everywhere, overcharge customers, and see how much chaos you can get away with.\n\n\ud83e\uddfd **Clean, Repair & Upgrade Vehicles**\n\nClean dirty cars, repair broken parts and help customers leave happy. Good work means more cash and better reviews.\n{4346779738983128}\n\n\ud83d\udd28 **Break, Steal & Create Chaos**\n\nUse tools to damage cars, steal parts, mess with customers, and turn every visit into a ridiculous moment.\n{1652454625981589}\n\ud83d\ude9a **Unlock Tools From the Delivery Truck**\n\nEarn money and spend it on new tools, weapons, items, and upgrades. Each unlock gives you new ways to serve customers\u2026 or cause trouble.\n{1369139395178203}\n\n\n\ud83d\ude93 **Catch Wanted Fugitives**\n\nThe sheriff may ask for your help. Spot wanted drivers in the queue, stop them, and earn special rewards.\n\n\n{1209173294567966}", "short_description": "Serve cars or creat